<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 8.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 8.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, April 8 on Monday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>			08.04.97     07.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.5188	 6.5616</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3632	 2.3922</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6064	 4.6574</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2116	 3.2349</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5223	 0.5263</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7893	 0.7981</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2954	 0.2990</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8900	 6.9150</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6972	 0.6967</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2939	 1.3021</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
